  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protection, Restoration, and Sustainable Use of Mangroves Forest (PRSUMF)-UNDP-SUR-01003610</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building on the achievements of GCCA+ project (phase one and phase two, the Protection, Restoration and Sustainable Use of Mangrove Forest (PRSUMF) project aims to support Suriname in building the resilience of target coastal communities through inclusive, gender-responsive coastal zone management, mangroves conservation, and sustainable use.</narrative>
  </description>
